			<div class="col-lg-4">
				<h2 class="heading">Bob Dylan Podcast<span class="text-primary">.</span> </h2>
			</div>
			<div class="col-lg-7">
				<p class="text-black-50">
					A collection of current projects where Mr Shale is working on, or where he is involved.
				</p>
