		<div class="row mb-5 justify-content-between">
			<div class="col-lg-6 text-black-100 order-lg-2">
				<p>
					The "Is It Rolling, Bob? Talking Dylan" podcast is a private project by Kerry Shale. The podcast is hosted by the actor Lucas Hare and him. Usually, the episodes are published in a four-week cycle. 
					Due to the reasons of personal health, the podcast had been on hiatus between June 2022 and April 2024. It had to do with the fact that Kerry Shale had to voice about 30 different characters for "The Amazing World Of Gumball" 
					series 7 and the movie where he needed to rest his voice whenever it was possible.
				</p>
				<p>
					Quote: "Actors Kerry Shale and Lucas Hare talk to interesting people about Bob Dylan. And lots of other things."
				</p>
				<p>
					Since the podcast is a project of Kerry Shale and Lucas Hare, they do own the copyright.
				</p>
				<p>
					Please follow them on Bluesky if you are a Bob Dylan fan.<br />
					- <a href="https://bsky.app/profile/isitrollingpod.bsky.social" target="_blank">Is It Rolling, Bob? Talking Dylan on Bluesky</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;[They are on X, too.]
				</p>
				<p>
					Update April 2024: They have started to work on new podcast episodes.<br />Stay tuned, follow them and wait for their announcements!<br />
					<iframe width="480" height="270" src="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/hRsHrEwZ26A?si=dSJdF8Sleee9N4s-"
							title="YouTube video player" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
							allowfullscreen class="rounded-3"></iframe>
				</p>
